flowchart LR
    S[SLO Impact Clear] --> I{Change identity matches?}
    I -->|否| B1[BLOCKED_IDENTITY\n不要混用別的 run 或 candidate]
    I -->|是| E{Required evidence\nstate and digest match?}
    E -->|否| B2[BLOCKED_EVIDENCE\n補齊或重新產生 evidence]
    E -->|是| P{Approval policy valid?}
    P -->|否| B3[BLOCKED_APPROVAL\nrole / age / scope / count]
    P -->|是| C[APPROVAL_ELIGIBLE\n交給 release owner]
    C --> H[HUMAN ACTION\n人類決定是否執行]
